                    A follow-up is <strong style="color:var(--c-text);">overdue</strong> when a customer visited the showroom
                    and their status is still <strong style="color:var(--c-text);">Pending</strong> after
                    <strong style="color:var(--c-text);">3 or more days</strong> without a callback.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>

